      <Step>
      <strong>Read the hierarchy</strong>
      <ul>
      <li>A <code>&lt;topicref&gt;</code> inside a <code>&lt;topicref&gt;</code> is a child topic. The output nests it in the table of contents and generates a "Parent topic" link on the child. <em>What is digital audio?</em> is now a child of <em>What is Audacity?</em>.</li>
      <li><code>@collection-type</code> on the parent says how its children relate. <code>family</code> means the children link to each other and to the parent; <code>sequence</code> means they are read in order, and each child gets "Previous topic" and "Next topic" links.</li>
