      <h2 id="step-2-remove-the-links-the-map-now-generates" class="group scroll-mt-20">Step 2: Remove the links the map now generates<a href="#step-2-remove-the-links-the-map-now-generates" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
